# Exclusions for the scripts/package tool.
#
# Guidelines: https://github.com/typst/packages/blob/main/docs/tips.md#what-to-commit-what-to-exclude
#
# Three groups of files:
# 1. Required   — needed at runtime (NOT listed here)
#    typst.toml, lib.typ, reshikist.wasm, LICENSE, LICENSE-APACHE, LICENSE-MIT,
#    NOTICE, README.md
#
# 2. Documentation — viewable on Typst Universe, excluded from archive via
#    typst.toml exclude: (NOT listed here)
#    examples/*
#
# 3. Other — not needed by end users and not linked in README
#    (listed below; these will not be committed to the registry repo at all)

.github
scripts
Justfile
CHANGELOG.md
